      "q": "How much does Boeing make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Boeing obligated $5.9B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Boeing received 473 awards in FY2026 to date, with an average award size of $12.4M, and obligations were up 34.4% year over year. Historical annual obligations include FY21 $7.3B, FY22 $3.9B, FY23 $3.3B, FY24 $5B, and FY25 $4.4B."
